stereo audio. Turbo doubles the speed for fast iteration.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-3hxlidtzf5oj-w8wqgdeqr15a-wo1qHx","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=minimax-h3-max","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"tfYklzUEkm","createdAt":"2026-09-04T12:43:28.618Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T12:43:28.618Z","title":"LTX 2.5 Fast & Pro Are Now on Coverr","description":"Lightricks' LTX 2.5 is live in Coverr's AI Video Generator. Native multi-shot scenes, synced audio, and clips up to 20 seconds — Fast reaches 4K, Pro adds a higher quality tier.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-omaw6pbwblzk-c0dxvcrnl3je-A3060Y","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=ltx-2-5-fast","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"TrrMGLg46o","createdAt":"2026-09-04T12:43:19.865Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T12:43:19.865Z","title":"Grok Imagine 2.0 Is Now on Coverr — xAI's Image Model","description":"Grok Imagine 2.0 is live in Coverr's AI Image Generator. Strong instruction following, sharp typography, and consistent characters across generations — built for design work.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-ldr26gwv0jtg-taykhhizfqfh-Ya3fqZ","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-images-generator?model=grok-2-0","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"Ha1v9XcFkw","createdAt":"2026-08-25T08:09:49.430Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T08:09:49.430Z","title":"Seedance 2.5 Now Outputs in 1080p","description":"Seedance 2.5 now generates at full 1080p on Coverr — sharper detail across its native 30-second clips, ready for polished social and brand content.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-lv03rksfhh6d-ssjwtnkgxjcx-z84fzC","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-5&resolution=1080p","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"oJlMhzQExR","createdAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:37.917Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:37.917Z","title":"Seedance 2.5 Is Now on Coverr — Native 30-Second Video","description":"ByteDance's Seedance 2.5 is live in Coverr's AI Video Generator. Generate a full 30-second clip in one native pass, with reference inputs and native audio in 10+ languages.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-tssqh4jvpr4l-mozslj8k96du-hkQZux","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-5","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"vkTB3mlJLw","createdAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:21.779Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:21.779Z","title":"Flux 3 Video Is Now on Coverr — Black Forest Labs' First Video Model","description":"Flux 3 is live in Coverr's AI Video Generator. Generate clips up to 20 seconds with native audio, strong facial expressions, multilingual dialogue, and lip-sync built in from the same model.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-yvb3lrxsn1dv-xtf64y6rdmdj-Gz8uri","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=flux-3","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"xGzJEOM5tu","createdAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:09.123Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-11T08:52:09.123Z","title":"MiniMax H3 Is Now on Coverr — 4K Video with Native Audio","description":"MiniMax H3 is live in Coverr's AI Video Generator. Generate 5–15 second clips at native 4K with synced stereo audio, from text, image, or reference inputs — built for ads, branding, and product content.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-qknlitlqpmgw-c0og1tkpadhh-9iem6A","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=minimax-h3","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"1oUoMaHbkQ","createdAt":"2026-08-11T08:29:52.544Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-11T08:29:52.544Z","title":"Grok Imagine Video 1.5 Now Outputs in 1080p","description":"Grok Imagine Video 1.5 now generates at full 1080p on Coverr — sharper detail for image-to-video, cleaner motion, ready for polished social and brand content.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-lvtinjln0zfu-d2fm8suhsl6g-61pmGm","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=grok-imagine-video-1.5&resolution=1080p","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"RTIP8DWDFd","createdAt":"2026-07-09T15:50:53.831Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-09T15:50:53.831Z","title":"Seedream 5.0 Pro Is Now on Coverr","description":"ByteDance's Seedream 5.0 Pro is live in Coverr's AI Image Generator. Sharper detail, better prompt accuracy, and accurate in-image text across 14 languages — built for commercial-grade output.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-xwxd5rbzxqsn-hujscp9sfg7z-4yvSsm","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-images-generator?model=bytedance-seedream-5.0-pro","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"lV6MKnDsqi","createdAt":"2026-07-08T13:15:39.180Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T13:15:39.180Z","title":"Introducing Marketing Studio — Create Ad Videos with Your Own Product","description":"Got a product? Marketing Studio turns it into a polished ad video. Upload your product, pick or create an avatar, describe the idea — and generate a ready-to-use marketing video in minutes.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-wrdao8b5unqh-t4vxuz1spqhp-efg1Rv","ctaUrl":"/studio/marketing","ctaCopy":"Open Marketing Studio","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"uOa4bDJF0k","createdAt":"2026-07-08T13:15:29.993Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T13:15:29.993Z","title":"Gemini Omni Flash Is Now on Coverr — Google's Newest AI Video Model","description":"Google's Gemini Omni Flash is live in Coverr's AI Video Generator. Generate 10-second cinematic clips from text or image inputs, with multimodal references and real-world knowledge baked in.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-q3jmzgrcvgsk-mcgmfgeekpzv-BtBQhl","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=google-gemini-omni-flash","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"7NIKg5j0Bi","createdAt":"2026-07-02T11:35:26.287Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T11:35:26.287Z","title":"Nano Banana 2 Lite Is Now on Coverr — Google's Fastest Image Model","description":"Google's newest image model is live in Coverr's AI Image Generator. Nano Banana 2 Lite generates images in ~20 seconds with strong character consistency and clean in-image text — built for speed and high-volume iteration.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-kk30cq6bv8l6-mm2weaujp7la-QfNfuq","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-images-generator?model=nano-banana-2-lite","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"04DiTpEQ57","createdAt":"2026-06-25T14:25:52.348Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T14:25:52.348Z","title":"Seedance 2.0 Mini Is Now on Coverr","description":"Seedance 2.0 Mini is now in your AI Video Generator — the lightweight tier of the Seedance 2.0 family. About half the cost, ~2x faster than Fast, with quality close to it. Built for high-volume, everyday clips.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-vqosxm03ag7o-out0lhauzy7x-E7xGmq","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-0-mini","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"2b9s1fOfVX","createdAt":"2026-06-25T13:06:50.206Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T13:06:50.206Z","title":"Seedance 2.0 Now Supports 4K","description":"Seedance 2.0 now generates native 4K video on Coverr — no upscaling. Sharper detail, cleaner textures, ready for brand videos and polished social content.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-0i88o9it8cbz-vnjpigszvh7a-XVAOEJ","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-0&resolution=4k","ctaCopy":"Try in 4K","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"rQ0XuetDop","createdAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:38.096Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:38.096Z","title":"Happy Horse 1.1 Is Now on Coverr — Sharper Motion, Better Lip-Sync","description":"We've upgraded Happy Horse to version 1.1 on Coverr's AI Video Generator. The update focuses on five targeted improvements: smoother, more physically grounded motion in fast-moving scenes — explosions, particle effects, dramatic weather — plus better handling of shot-reverse-shot and tracking shots for more natural multi-shot transitions.\n\nAudio gets an upgrade too: more natural dialogue pacing, richer ambient sound, and tighter lip-sync with less drift. Character and product consistency across multi-reference shots is also stronger, so brand details and identities hold up better across cuts.\n\nSame model you know, noticeably more refined output.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-d7n7eprvveyg-bycpyryn5h8h-IZ487j","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=happy-horse-1.1","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"48UmojeyqG","createdAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:29.846Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:29.846Z","title":"Kling 3.0 Turbo & Turbo Pro Are Now on Coverr","description":"We've added Kling 3.0 Turbo and Kling 3.0 Turbo Pro to Coverr's AI Video Generator — speed-tuned tier of the Kling 3.0 family.\n\nBoth models keep the strengths that make Kling 3.0 useful: strong prompt adherence, multi-shot scenes that hold character and setting consistent across cuts, and native audio with noticeably improved lip sync. They just get you there faster — built for batches of clips, quick variations, and testing ideas before committing to a final.\n\nTurbo Pro adds stronger consistency for image-to-video work, making it the better pick when a product's exact look needs to hold steady frame to frame.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-izixc2e1vd6j-arasdcffmekn-2qGYH2","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=kling-3-0-turbo","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"iVBv5TClCD","createdAt":"2026-06-22T13:33:37.694Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T13:03:51.603Z","title":"Lyria 3 and Lyria 3 Pro Are Now on Coverr — The Ultimate AI Music Models","description":"We've added Lyria 3 and Lyria 3 Pro to Coverr's AI Audio Generator — the latest music generation models from Google DeepMind.\n\nThe workflow is seamless: generate cinematic soundtracks, adaptive background ambiance, or full vocal tracks — tailored to your visuals in just one click. Lyria 3 is built for short instrumental clips (up to ~30 seconds), perfect for quick stings, loops, and background beds. Lyria 3 Pro generates full-length compositions (up to 3 minutes) with vocals, richer arrangements, and orchestral-level detail — ideal when your scene needs depth and emotional range.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/nuzo21efvuka-images-bmh4bnmk3yji-yfkkea0pexqb-LJxnsv","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-audio-generator?model=google-lyria-3-pro","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"d03zIbUK2X","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.130Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.130Z","title":"Grok 1.5 Is Now on Coverr — xAI's #1 Image-to-Video Model","description":"We've added Grok 1.5 to Coverr's AI Video Generator — xAI's latest model that currently sits at #1 on the Image-to-Video Arena leaderboard, outranking Seedance 2.0 and HappyHorse 1.0 in blind user testing.\n\nThe workflow is straightforward: upload a still image, describe the motion, camera move, and sound design — and the model animates the scene. Audio is generated in the same pass, no separate step needed. Synchronized dialogue, sound effects, and ambient audio are all baked in from the start.\n\nBuilt on xAI's Aurora autoregressive architecture, 1.5 keeps the lighting, details, and identity of your source image intact while bringing the scene to life.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-ghc1snensmxi-5xdzwcoivtg8-A4xqh6","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=grok-imagine-video-1.5","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false}],"total":40,"page":0,"pageSize":20,"pages":2,"nbHits":40,"nbPages":2,"hitsPerPage":20},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https://public-api.coverr.co/product-updates","rt":"json"},"3348281725":{"b":{"hits":[{"id":"ugWWBhq0RX","createdAt":"2025-05-30T14:18:22.216Z","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T14:30:18.538Z","title":"AI Music Generator","description":"Instantly create custom, royalty-free music tracks tailored to your video’s mood and style.","imageUrl":null,"ctaUrl":null,"ctaCopy":null,"status":"new","isPublished":true,"type":"idea","votesCount":24,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"wHkpwWOOcx","createdAt":"2025-05-30T14:18:04.437Z","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T14:30:11.097Z","title":"VFX & Motion Elements","description":"Add cinematic effects, transitions, and animated overlays to bring your videos to life.","imageUrl":null,"ctaUrl":null,"ctaCopy":null,"status":"new","isPublished":true,"type":"idea","votesCount":24,"hasVoted":false}],"total":2,"page":0,"pageSize":20,"pages":1,"nbHits":2,"nbPages":1,"hitsPerPage":20},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https://public-api.coverr.co/product-updates","rt":"json"},"3418677093":{"b":{"id":"PT59yQfZ6Mep