","order":2,"key":"golden-hour","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-Oh2xKB","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-q4lT7gaELpqI/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"NmAHiQ0rXHAZ","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Dusk veil","prompt":"Reimagine the moment just after sunset — a gentle transition between light and night. The sky glows with faint orange fading to blue, soft diffused light and introspective calm. Inspired by “Her” and “Before Sunset”, it should feel intimate and nostalgic, with smooth, subtle gradients and balanced exposure.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":3,"key":"dusk-veil","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-v5a2Jn","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-J1diJV7zBSop/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"WlgC5oS1vmJg","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Midnight calm","prompt":"Transform the scene into a serene midnight setting — illuminated softly by moonlight, with deep blues, gentle shadows, and minimal artificial light. The mood is quiet, introspective, and cinematic, emphasizing stillness and subtle motion in the dark. Inspired by “Lost in Translation” or “In the Mood for Love”.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":4,"key":"midnight-calm","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-Op2lqO","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-aTxjgh6EIlEs/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"v94U2MROlRLx","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Starlit silence","prompt":"Recreate the world under a vast night sky — moonlight casting silver illumination, stars shimmering with cosmic quiet. The atmosphere feels meditative, timeless, and infinite. Inspired by “Gravity” and “Ad Astra”, emphasize serenity, spatial depth, and slow movement under a celestial canopy.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":5,"key":"starlit-silence","imagePreviewUrl":"http