e asset updates, Social/video repurposing and reformatting, Multilingual captioning/subtitling, Creative ideation from moodboards and style guides, Compliance-safe content revisions","keyStrengths":"Best-in-class multimodal reference understanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"mhBe6vvoncHX","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:12:22.780Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.041Z","name":"Try On Sneakers","title":"Try On Sneakers","description":"Dedicated footwear presentation template mapping lower-body steps, sole profiles, and leather/mesh textures.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":14,"key":"try_on_sneakers","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Try On Sneakers\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a dedicated footwear demonstration prompt that eliminates foot-sliding and locks framing below the waist.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user specifies the sneaker model, colors, materials (mesh, leather, suede), and the outfit style (socks/pants).\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a strict lower-body motion prompt:\n- **Framing Lock:** \"Camera framing is strictly locked below the waist. Head and torso are cropped out. Focus entirely on legs, feet, and sneakers.\"\n- **Surface Definition:** You MUST explicitly define a solid, textured ground substrate to prevent AI foot-sliding or floating: \"The sneakers stand on a highly detailed polished concrete floor with realistic seam lines and light reflections.\"\n- **Motion Phase Breakdown:** \n  - **0–4s (Step-in):** Feet step cleanly into the frame from the side, planting firmly on the ground.\n  - **4–9s (Sole Pivot):** The left foot lifts and pivots on the heel, tilting up to reveal the detailed rubber sole profile and tread texture directly toward the lens.\n  - **9–15s (Walking Gait):** A natural walking gait away from and back toward the camera, captured in a tracking shot.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Framing explicitly restricted to below the waist (head/torso cropped).\n- Ground surface substrate must be heavily detailed to bind feet to floor coordinates.\n- Multi-phase movement breakdown detailed by specific seconds.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Grounding Physics:** Insist on realistic weight distribution and crisp sole-to-floor contact points.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"White leather sneakers with a green sole, jeans, light wooden floor.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, smooth tracking camera shot. Camera framing is strictly locked below the waist, head and torso completely cropped out. The subject wears dark denim straight-leg jeans. The sneakers stand on a highly detailed light hardwood floor with visible oak grain textures, planks, and soft natural daylight reflections. 0–4s (Step-in): Feet step cleanly into center frame from the right, weight shifts naturally, planting firmly onto the wood floor. 4–9s (Sole Pivot): The left foot lifts slightly and pivots cleanly on the heel, tilting the toe upward to reveal a detailed vibrant dark green rubber sole profile and grip tread texture directly toward the macro lens. 9–15s (Walking Gait): The feet execute a natural walking gait three paces away from the camera, then turn and walk back, sole contact points crisp and completely grounded without sliding.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","un