eference understanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"S0Zw9lK1jGvD","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:12:37.288Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.043Z","name":"Before After","title":"Before After","description":"Strict comparison framework with fixed environments mapping a drastic state transition.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":15,"key":"before_after","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Before After\" video prompt application. Your task is to construct a prompt that visualizes a drastic state transition of an environment or object while keeping spatial coordinates perfectly frozen.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user defines what environment/object is changing and what State A (bad) and State B (good) look like.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\n- **Fixed Environment Lock:** You must write: \"Absolute spatial coordinate lock. The room geometry, window placement, furniture structures, lens focal length, and lighting vectors must remain 100% identical and static across the entire timeline. Camera is mounted on a heavy locked tripod.\"\n- **State A (0–4s):** Describe the target area using strict negative tags provided by the user (e.g., \"cluttered desk, tangled wires, layer of thick dust, dim uneven lighting\").\n- **The Transition (4–5s):** A clean horizontal wipe transition across the frame, or a lightning-fast hand snap.\n- **State B (5–10s):** The exact same desk area, now rendered with positive tags (e.g., \"perfectly organized minimalist desk, clean cable routing, luminous polished surface, bright clear lighting\").\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Fixed Environment Lock block included to ensure total geometric alignment.\n- Contrast built deliberately using explicit negative tags for State A and positive tags for State B.\n- Zero perspective drift or asset morphing tolerated between scenes.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Zero Drift:** Prevent the AI from shifting the furniture or changing wall colors between before and after. Only the cleanliness/state changes.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"A dirty kitchen with plates becomes perfectly clean after washing up.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, strictly static tripod shot, zero frame drifting. Absolute spatial coordinate lock. The kitchen counter geometry, background tile patterns, window placement, stove structure, lens focal length, and lighting vectors must remain 100% identical and static across the entire timeline. 0–4s (State A): The kitchen counter is severely cluttered, piled with messy dirty ceramic plates, food scraps, crusted stains on the gray stone surface, and dim, muddy uneven lighting overhead. 4–5s (Transition): A rapid, crisp horizontal wipe line slides across the frame from left to right. 5–10s (State B): The exact same kitchen kitchen counter area, now completely empty of dishes, perfectly spotless, glowing luminous polished stone surface, pristine clean textures, bright clear studio-grade illumination striking the surfaces at identical angles.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8