ed suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"UGD5rMdUWlr1","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:13:02.832Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.053Z","name":"TVC","title":"TVC","description":"Traditional top-tier broadcast scale video with majestic tracking shots and studio master lighting.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_commercial","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":17,"key":"tvc","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"TVC Mastergrade\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a premium, high-end broadcast television commercial prompt characterized by mathematically smooth, mechanical camera paths.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user provides the premium product name, design reference details, and commercial color palette.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\n- **Zero-Human Camera Clause:** You must explicitly state: \"Absolute ban on handheld camera aesthetics. Zero micro-shake, zero organic drifting. The camera moves exclusively along a simulated hydraulic robotic crane line or heavy precision dolly track.\"\n- **Studio Master Lighting Grid:** \"Arri-grade cinematic rim-lighting separating the product from the dark background, soft multi-directional key fills, high-end commercial diffusion, seamless gradient reflections gliding along the product surfaces.\"\n- **Camera Path:** A slow, elegant, expensive-looking horizontal dolly tracking shot or an isometric sweeping crane lift that moves smoothly from a low-angle to a top-down hero layout.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Complete exclusion of organic handheld camera traits (verbatim Zero-Human Camera Clause).\n- Industrial-grade studio lighting setup specified precisely (Arri-grade, rim-lighting).\n- Mechanical camera mechanisms designated (dolly track, crane line).\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Product Consistency:** Include a strict instruction to lock product dimensions.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Premium glass facial serum bottle, luxury studio commercial, gold and black color palette.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nHigh-end broadcast television commercial look, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio, ultra-premium production value. Absolute ban on handheld camera aesthetics. Zero micro-shake, zero organic drifting. The camera moves exclusively along a simulated precision hydraulic dolly track. Studio Master Lighting Grid: Arri-grade cinematic rim-lighting separating a heavy dark-amber glass serum bottle from a pitch-black minimalist studio backdrop, soft multi-directional key fills, high-end commercial diffusion, seamless gradient gold light reflections gliding perfectly along the cylindrical glass edges. The camera executes a slow, majestic horizontal dolly tracking shot moving past the bottle. The product design must maintain rigid geometric symmetry, unyielding material properties, and immaculate glossy surface finishes with liquid inside perfectly stable throughout the entire tracking path. Ultra-sharp micro detail.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/requests/$REQUEST_ID","textToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/text-to-video","imageToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/image-to-video","videoToVideoEndpointSlug":null},"config":{"textToVideo":true,"imageToVideo":true,"videoToVideo":false,"hasAudio":true,"isOneImage":false,"isStartImageRequired":false,"isEndImageRequired":false,"isVideoRequired":false,"hasReference