raries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]}],"total":36,"page":0,"pageSize":100,"pages":1,"nbHits":36,"nbPages":1,"hitsPerPage":100},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https://public-api.coverr.co/ai-video-apps","rt":"json"},"4046002681":{"b":{"hits":[{"id":"WlW0CDKxXtrm","createdAt":"2025-11-25T11:29:15.037Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T11:02:38.652Z","key":"free_monthly","name":"Free","description":"Basic access with limited features","price":"0.00","order":0,"effectivePrice":"0.00","discountPercent":0,"monthlyCredits":1000,"paddleProductPrice