","order":0,"key":"first-light","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-jRSO6V","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-aCzAwWGo1uZi/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"zNqZ7MyaQYPF","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Noon blaze","prompt":"Recreate the environment under harsh midday sunlight — strong contrast, deep shadows, warm sand-toned highlights. The mood feels restless and raw, evoking intensity and human endurance. Inspired by “Lawrence of Arabia”. Keep camera angles and subject composition, emphasizing the stark clarity of full daylight.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":1,"key":"noon-blaze","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-K6DLO1","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-L2cNwxIociwt/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"zMnIOtLefMa8","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Golden hour","prompt":"Transform the video into golden hour — radiant sunlight, long shadows, and glowing amber tones that bathe the scene in cinematic warmth. Skin tones are luminous, reflections soft and romantic. Inspired by “La La Land”, the mood feels dreamy and emotionally open. Preserve natural motion and perspective.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":2,"key":"golden-hour","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-Oh2xKB","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-q4lT7gaELpqI/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"NmAHiQ0rXHAZ","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Dusk veil","prompt":"Reimagine the moment just after sunset — a gentle transition between light and night. The sky glows with faint orange fading to blue, soft diffused light and introspective calm. Inspired by “Her” and “Before Sunset”, it should feel intimate and nostalgic, with smooth, subtle gradients and balanced exposure.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":3,"key":"dusk-veil","imagePreviewUrl":"https:/