?width=1920","thumbnail":"https://cdn.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-VlzTMEbjgVkr/thumbnail?width=640","playbackId":null,"duration":"4.000000","aspectRatio":"9:16","maxHeight":1280,"maxWidth":720,"urls":{"mp4":"https://cdn.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-VlzTMEbjgVkr/1080p.mp4","mp4Preview":"https://cdn.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-VlzTMEbjgVkr/360p.mp4","mp4Download":"https://cdn.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-VlzTMEbjgVkr/1080p.mp4?download=true"},"sequenceId":null,"scene":null,"blurHash":"UD6INt.Tx]xu.T%$x^tRxux]x]tRyEtRoeoz","isPremium":false,"fps":30,"isAiGenerated":true,"slug":"calm-hospital-room-at-night","createdBy":"0lnfzyfKyLC8","hasAudio":true,"translations":null,"allSlugs":["calm-hospital-room-at-night"]},"presets":[{"id":"hMX1vXOeoUP4","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Blinding sun","prompt":"Transform the scene into a scorching daylight environment under a blinding desert sun. Introduce intense heat shimmer, bleached tones, and high contrast lighting that conveys raw energy and survival. Inspired by “Mad Max: Fury Road”, it should feel relentless, sun-baked, and cinematic. Preserve original subject and motion with harsh directional light and dry air distortion.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":0,"key":"blinding-sun","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-vlM7Tu","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-BLei1gN9HMqE/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"SpXgHx8yarYF","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Eternal fog","prompt":"Reimagine the scene enveloped in soft, cinematic fog — mist rolling gently through the landscape while preserving clear visibility of the main subject and key details. The atmosphere should feel mysterious yet balanced, with diffused light, cool desaturated tones, and subtle depth. Inspired by “Silent Hill” and “The Others”, evoke a haunting stillness without obscuring composition or focal clarity.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":1,"key":"eternal-fog","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-1pRtm9","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-ekUaCHF2oPNb/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"DWrqzkuXMnIK","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Neo noir rain","prompt":"Convert the environment into a rainy, reflective world — heavy rainfall, wet surfaces, neon and car light reflections creating a moody urban atmosphere. Inspired by “Blade Runner 2049”, emphasize cinematic lighting, contrast, and motion through glistening surfaces. Preserve original subject and framing while enhancing depth and emotional weight.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":2,"key":"neo-noir-rain","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-gMTGp7","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-IpPrlDDn1eBW/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"guE6ai8giMLZ","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Frozen silence","prompt":"Transform the scene into a snow-covered, frozen landscape. Add drifting snowflakes, pale blue light, and muted desaturated tones that evoke cold isolation. Inspired by “The Revenant”, it should feel tactile and immersive, with visible breath and gentle wind movement. Maintain natural motion, focusing on atmosphere and texture.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":3,"key":"frozen-silence","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-AwjTL0","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-LmomlO5BKGM3/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"p26GQFJgUcZv","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Apocalyptic dust","prompt":"Turn the setting into a chaotic sandstorm or post-collapse wasteland — swirling dust clouds, reduced visibility, and an orange-brown dystopian palette. Inspired by “Dune” and “Interstellar”, emphasize motion in the air, grainy light diffusion, and tension in the atmosphere. Preserve subject motion while immersing them in the storm’s intensity.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":4,"key":"apocalyptic-dust","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-khRQUW","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-UIvjmPIQn6Wa/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"WOxfpj7bmFjB","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Electric storm","prompt":"Transform the world into a high-drama thunderstorm — dark rolling clouds, flashes of lightning illuminating the scene, and a palpable sense of tension. Inspired by “Inception” dream-collapse sequences, combine dynamic lighting, wet reflections, and cinematic pacing. Maintain realism and keep subject motion intact amid the electrified chaos.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":5,"key":"electric-storm","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-lqOVBD","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-dydjDQAVFe2y/1080p.mp4"}]},{"id":"NgGH2GgIlwtY","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:13:47.589Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.030Z","name":"Gadget Saved Me","title":"Gadget Saved Me","description":"Problem-solving format focused on an intense emotional and situational contrast (frustration to absolute relief).","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_tik_tok","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":9,"key":"gadget_saved_me","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Gadget Saved Me\" video prompt application. Your task is to turn a user's product description into a technical script for video-AI models, focusing on an intense emotional and situational contrast (frustration to absolute relief).\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nAccept the user's product and specific problem details. Wrap them tightly into the framework below. The user's input dictates the product features, while you enforce the cinematic structure.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a single prompt with clear timestamps. Every segment must explicitly detail the camera, subject action, and dialogue:\n- **0–3s (Frustration Hook):** Medium shot. The creator is in active physical distress, annoyance, or panic within a realistic everyday setting. Vivid facial expressions of stress (frowning, sighing, tense shoulders).\n- **3–7s (Solution Reveal):** Smooth match cut or camera pan. The product enters the frame. The creator's expression instantly shifts to deep, authentic relief. The product is held clearly in hand.\n- **7–15s (Benefit Demo):** Close-up shot showing the product successfully eliminating the specific painful situation. The action is smooth and deliberate.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Every word must have a direct visual or audio purpose. No meta-text.\n- Zero vague qualitative language (\"feels like\", \"sort of\").\n- Camera angle, framing, and lighting source are explicitly stated per segment.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **No Buzzwords:** Banned: cinematic, photorealistic, amazing, beautiful. Replace with physical descriptors.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Magnetic power bank for iPhone, saves the day when the phone dies on a plane before landing.\"\n**Expected Output:**\n0–3s (Frustration Hook): Handheld vertical 9:16 smartphone camera look, low-angle medium shot. A young man sits in a cramped airplane seat, frantically tapping a dead iPhone screen. His forehead is creased, teeth biting his lower lip in visible panic. Dim overhead cabin lighting, natural shadows. Dialogue: \"My battery is literally at 1%, and my boarding pass won't even load! What do I do?\"\n3–7s (Solution Reveal): Quick pan down to his hands. A sleek, matte-black magnetic power bank snaps directly onto the back of the iPhone with a crisp metallic click. The screen instantly lights up with a green charging icon. The man's facial muscles relax completely, exhaling with a wide, relieved sigh. \n7–15s (Benefit Demo): Macro close-up shot focusing on the secure magnetic alignment of the power bank against the phone. The phone screen shows the boarding pass barcode in sharp focus. Studio-grade diffused window light. Dialogue: \"This magnetic pack seriously saved me right before boarding.\"","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/requests/$REQUEST_ID","textToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/text-to-video","imageToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/image-to-video","videoToVideoEndpointSlug":null},"config":{"textToVideo":true,"imageToVideo":true,"videoToVideo":false,"hasAudio":true,"isOneImage":false,"isStartImageRequired":false,"isEndImageRequired":false,"isVideoRequi