tion and editing model","topUseCases":"Brand and campaign adaptations, Product catalog and e-commerce asset updates, Social/video repurposing and reformatting, Multilingual captioning/subtitling, Creative ideation from moodboards and style guides, Compliance-safe content revisions","keyStrengths":"Best-in-class multimodal reference understanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"gdnaKxx0oE3n","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:11:32.225Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.035Z","name":"Hyper Motion","title":"Hyper Motion","description":"High-velocity cinematic commercial using aggressive speed ramps and kinetic transitions.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_commercial","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":11,"key":"hyper_motion","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Hyper Motion\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a high-velocity, kinetic commercial video prompt utilizing aggressive speed ramping and physics shifts.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user defines the product and the fast-paced environment (e.g., urban streets, athletic track).\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a highly dynamic commercial prompt using these precise camera acceleration vectors:\n- **0–2s (Acceleration Sweep):** \"Aggressive whip-pan camera transition, hyper-lapse motion blur on environmental boundaries, extreme camera acceleration rushing past background structures toward the product.\"\n- **2–4s (The Matrix Freeze):** \"Sudden high-contrast time-drop into ultra slow-motion matrix time. The camera speed freezes completely while holding on a tight macro close-up of a micro product detail (e.g., a fluid droplet hanging mid-air, a mechanism locking).\"\n- **4–8s (Burst Exit):** \"Explosive camera acceleration burst, tracking outward from the detail into a wide dynamic angle, clean atmospheric glow accents trailing the product movement.\"\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Specific motion interpolation terms included (whip-pan, speed ramp, matrix freeze).\n- Clear delineation between high-velocity sweeps and absolute ultra slow-motion drops.\n- Visual artifacts barred; clarity maintained during extreme motions.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Time Interpolation:** Use specific technical timing words to direct the video model's physics engine.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Running sneakers dashing through a night neon city, dynamic transitions.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, high-end kinetic commercial aesthetic, dramatic high-contrast grading. 0–2s (Acceleration Sweep): Aggressive whip-pan camera transition, hyper-lapse motion blur on environmental boundaries, extreme camera acceleration rushing horizontally along an asphalt street past glowing neon cyberpunk city signs directly toward a black running sneaker. 2–4s (The Matrix Freeze): Sudden high-contrast time-drop into ultra slow-motion matrix time; the camera speed freezes completely, orbiting slowly around a tight macro close-up of a neon-green outsole tread compression as it impacts a puddle, water droplets frozen perfectly mid-air in razor-sharp focus. 4–8s (Burst Exit): Explosive camera acceleration burst tracking backward and upward away from the shoe into a wide heroic low-angle tracking shot, light trails and clean atmospheric glow accents trailing the rapid forward sprint.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"vid