"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"eW92ScxcZ1aI","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:11:05.520Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.055Z","name":"Direct to Camera","title":"Direct to Camera","description":"Clean, framed vertical presentation with a stable tripod look, optimized for clear delivery.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_tik_tok","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":18,"key":"direct_to_camera","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Direct to Camera\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a clean, highly stable talking-head video prompt optimized for instructional delivery.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user's text defines who the speaker is and what product they are discussing.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a structured, stable video prompt:\n- **Framing & Eye-Lock:** \"Strictly static tripod shot, zero frame drifting, centered medium shot. The subject's eyes are perfectly aligned with the top third of the lens. Absolute eye-contact lock with the lens, stabilized pupils with zero flickering or AI gaze drifting.\"\n- **Environment & Lighting:** \"Soft commercial interior studio background, heavily blurred with a shallow depth of field (f/1.8). Professional two-point softbox lighting setup creating a bright, clear face with sharp focus on the iris and teeth.\"\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- No camera motion allowed (strictly locked tripod asset).\n- Gaze stability must be explicitly commanded (eye-contact lock).\n- Studio lighting layout must be fully specified.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **No Handheld Artifacts:** Explicitly ban hand tremors or lens movement. Keep it completely locked down.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"An expert wearing a blazer explains the benefits of a new cloud infrastructure optimization software.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nStrictly static tripod shot, zero frame drifting, centered medium shot, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio. A professional man in his late 30s wearing a dark tailored blazer over a crisp white t-shirt stands centered. His eyes are perfectly aligned with the top third of the lens, executing an absolute eye-contact lock with the lens, stabilized pupils with zero flickering. Background is a modern soft commercial office interior, heavily blurred with a shallow depth of field (f/1.8). Professional two-point softbox lighting setup illuminates his face evenly, creating sharp catchlights in his irises. High-detail skin texture, sharp focus on facial expressions and speech lip movements. Dialogue: \"Automating cloud resource cleanup drops your monthly server spend by exactly forty percent.\"","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": c