ing versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"VqjT0pE81z0I","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:14:12.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.072Z","name":"UGC","title":"UGC","description":"Classic lifelike user-generated video focused on product interaction within lifestyle settings.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":23,"key":"ugc","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Standard UGC\" video prompt application. Your task is to create an organic, life-like user-generated video prompt where the product is casually integrated into an everyday lifestyle routine.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nApply the user's chosen product, environment, and creator profile directly into the native framework.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\n- **Aesthetic Control:** Banned: commercial studio lights, perfect renders, glowing clean rooms. Enforced: \"native interior room light (e.g., morning sunlight coming from a side window, standard warm incandescent ceiling lamp), soft natural shadows\".\n- **Product Realism:** The product must look real, used, and integrated (e.g., minor fingerprints on a glass surface, natural fabric wrinkles on apparel, non-pristine packaging).\n- **Timeline:** (0-5s Hook gesture with product -> 5-10s casual user interaction -> 10-15s integration shot showing it in active use on a normal desk or counter).\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- No high-end glossy textures or synthetic digital gleam.\n- Lighting strictly dictated by ambient room elements.\n- Frame features natural handheld micro-movements.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Output Style:** Casual creator video aesthetic, organic textures, zero digital gloss, handheld minor motion blur.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Cosmetics organizer on a blogger's desk, morning, regular bedroom.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nCasual creator video aesthetic, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio, subtle handheld camera movement. A young woman with hair tied back sits at a normal wooden desk in a bedroom. Soft morning sunlight streams in from a side window, casting natural long shadows across the surface. No studio lights. On the desk sits a clear acrylic makeup organizer containing used lipsticks, palettes, and brushes; the plastic surface shows minor, realistic wipe marks and fingerprints. 0-5s: She pulls the organizer drawer open with a quick gesture, smiling casually. Voiceover: \"My mornings finally start without total chaos on the desk.\" 5-10s: Her hand selects a brush, demonstrating the practical layout. 10-15s: Wide shot of her applying powder, the organizer resting naturally in the foreground setup. High-detail plastic and wood textures, sharp focus.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/requests/$REQUEST_ID","textToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/text-to-video","imageToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/image-to-video","videoToVideoEndpointSlug":null},"config":{"textToVideo":true,"imageToVideo":true,"videoToVideo":false,"hasAudio":true,"isOneImage":false,"isStartImageRequired":false,"isEndImageRequired":false,"isVideoRequired":false,"