s-to-video","audio"],"content":{"modelType":"Multimodal reference-driven generation and editing model","topUseCases":"Brand and campaign adaptations, Product catalog and e-commerce asset updates, Social/video repurposing and reformatting, Multilingual captioning/subtitling, Creative ideation from moodboards and style guides, Compliance-safe content revisions","keyStrengths":"Best-in-class multimodal reference understanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"Ozc5gaMGzy2E","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:09:31.580Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.078Z","name":"Secret Hack","title":"Secret Hack","description":"Curated 'insider secret' format that positions the product as an exclusive life-hack.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_tik_tok","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":25,"key":"secret_hack","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Secret Hack\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a high-engagement script that positions the user's product as an exclusive, insider life-hack.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nUse the user's product and its hidden/non-obvious feature as the core of the video. \n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a single prompt with clear timestamps:\n- **0–2s (Insider Hook):** Extreme close-up or medium close-up. The creator looks directly into the lens, performing a physical \"hushing\" gesture (finger to lips) or leaning in drastically close to the camera to establish an exclusive vibe.\n- **2–8s (Step-by-Step Execution):** Medium shot of hands manipulating the product in an unconventional, highly efficient, or hidden way. Focus on macro details of the interaction.\n- **8–15s (Mind-blown Result):** Close-up on the creator's face showing a genuine \"mind-blown\" reaction (widened eyes, slight smile), followed by a shot demonstrating the final successful outcome of the hack.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Every word has a visual or audio purpose. No purpose/context descriptions.\n- No vague qualifiers. Camera framing and hand placements are exact.\n- No cinematic or photorealistic buzzwords used.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Camera Spec:** Use \"handheld vertical 9:16 smartphone lens compression, slight natural hand micro-tremor, macro focus cuts on hands\".\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Hidden touch sensitive button on wireless earbuds to activate noise cancellation.\"\n**Expected Output:**\n0–2s (Insider Hook): Handheld vertical 9:16 smartphone camera look. Extreme close-up of a creator leaning in tightly toward the lens, raising a single index finger to their lips in a swift \"hushing\" gesture, looking directly into the camera with raised eyebrows. Soft ambient room lighting. Dialogue: \"Keep scrolling if you don't want to find out the secret feature on these headphones.\"\n2–8s (Step-by-Step Execution): Match cut to a close-up profile shot. Creator's hand reaches up to the wireless earbud. The index finger taps and holds a hidden seamless sensor area on the lower stem for two seconds. Macro focus on the finger contact point, sharp edges, visible skin texture.\n8–15s (Mind-blown Result): Tight close-up on the creator's face. Their eyes instantly widen, a slow genuine smile spreads across their face as the background traffic noise vanishes. Sharp focus, clear iris details, natural skin pores visible. Dialogue: \"Just hold it right here for two seconds to activate total silence instantly.\"","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxP