 guides, Compliance-safe content revisions","keyStrengths":"Best-in-class multimodal reference understanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"YklULrUkCxl0","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:09:02.370Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.080Z","name":"Wild Card","title":"Wild Card","description":"High-concept abstract loop optimizing surreal liquid dynamics, physics-defying structures, or 3D explosions.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_commercial","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":26,"key":"wild_card","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Wild Card\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a high-concept, abstract creative commercial prompt that deliberately breaks real-world physics laws while maintaining structural readability.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user provides the core product and an abstract concept or theme (e.g., liquid chrome, floating particles, anti-gravity).\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a prompt that completely re-engineers motion physics:\n- **Physics Modification Command:** You must explicitly instruct the AI to defy physical constraints using clear visual actions (e.g., \"Refined liquid metal chrome flowing upward against the laws of gravity, enveloping the product in slow motion\", \"A solid glass cube shattering outward into thousands of clean 3D typographical particles, which then slowly levitate and suspended mid-air\").\n- **Structural Readability Lock:** To avoid AI melting or chaotic morphing, you must state: \"Maintain ultra-sharp rendering quality with absolute structural readability. All edges of the shattered fragments and flowing liquids must remain crisp, glossy, and distinctly defined, with physically accurate ray-traced reflections.\"\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Clear \"Physics Modification Command\" detailing an impossible physical movement.\n- Mandatory \"Structural Readability Lock\" included textually to minimize AI rendering chaos.\n- Lighting described through advanced terminology (ray-traced reflections, refraction).\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Abstract Focus:** Focus heavily on material phase shifts and surreal camera warp movements.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"A watch dissolves into liquid silver that flies upwards in zero gravity.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nHigh-concept abstract creative commercial, vertical 9:16, macro lens depth, hyper-surreal motion physics. A high-end minimalist wrist watch floats centered in a void. 0-4s: The solid metallic body of the watch executes a fluid material phase shift, dissolving and shattering into a cloud of thousands of glowing, refined liquid metal chrome droplets that break physical constraints by flowing upward against the laws of gravity in slow motion. 4-8s: The camera performs a surreal warp panning sweep through the floating liquid cloud. Maintain ultra-sharp rendering quality with absolute structural readability. All edges of the flowing metallic silver liquids must remain crisp, glossy, and distinctly defined, casting physically accurate ray-traced reflections onto each other in an infinite black void with soft white directional light fields.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T11:49:16.444Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"htt